      "title": "Love Letters: First Bloom \ud83c\udf38",
      "date": "2025-02-12 17:19:36",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1791482680870369",
      "content": "We're thrilled to announce the release of our new word puzzle game on Steam! \r\n[h1]Love Letters: First Bloom[/h1]\r\noffers a fresh take on the genre by blending engaging word challenges with the peaceful ambiance of a spring garden.\r\n\r\n[b]Try the free demo version today![/b]\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf38 A unique word puzzle experience in [b]multiple languages[/b]\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf38 [b]Mysterious blocks[/b] and [b]locked letters[/b] that reveal themselves as you solve\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf38 [b]Pattern matching puzzle[/b] for extra fun\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf38 [b]Infinite puzzles[/b] ensuring endless fun\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf38 [b]Soothing soundtrack [/b]to accompany your word-crafting journey\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf38 Full [b]mouse and keyboard [/b]support for your preferred playstyle\r\n\r\nWhether you're a word game enthusiast or simply seeking a peaceful gaming experience, Love Letters: First Bloom provides the perfect balance of challenge and relaxation. \r\n\r\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/3442660/Love_Letters_First_Bloom/]Available now on Steam! [/url]\r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in this enchanting blend of wordplay and springtime serenity. \r\n\r\nFree demo!\r\n[b]Launch Discount: 20% off![/b]\r\n",
      "key": "2497500::ad36f39016637b612a57268cbd3a2c0ffe64cd41",
